<view class="group-check-page">
  <view class="group-check-topbar">
    <view class="group-check-topbar__back" bindtap="goBack">
      <view class="group-check-topbar__back-icon"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="group-check-topbar__title">{{currentTitle}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="group-check-tabs">
    <block wx:for="{{platformTabs}}" wx:key="key">
      <view
        class="group-check-tabs__item {{item.key === activeTab ? 'group-check-tabs__item--active' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="switchTab"
      >
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="group-check-card">
    <input
      class="group-check-card__input"
      placeholder="{{currentPlaceholder || '请输入核销码'}}"
      value="{{codeInput}}"
      bindinput="onCodeInput"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="group-check-submit" bindtap="submitCheck">立即核销</view>

  <view class="group-check-desc">
    <view class="group-check-desc__title">核销说明：</view>
    <view class="group-check-desc__item">1. 打开团购平台订单页面，复制券码，将券码粘贴至上面的文本输入框。</view>
    <view class="group-check-desc__item">2. 点击上面的“立即核销”按钮，核销成功后到账卡券。</view>
    <view class="group-check-desc__item">3. 核销成功，不予退款。</view>
  </view>
</view>
